  "$id": "https://clawdipedia.cc/schemas/claude-code-keybindings.json",
  "title": "Claude Code keybindings.json (Claude Code 2.1.316)",
  "$comment": "For ~/.claude/keybindings.json. Generated from Claude Code 2.1.316 by calling the zod v4 toJSONSchema embedded in the binary on its own validator (method A, runtime export). Do not edit by hand: run \"bun run schemas\".",
